---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Blog
description: Notes on grant readiness, funder expectations, and nonprofit funding strategy from Tram Ngo.
permalink: /blog/index.html
---
<div class="blog-wrap">
  <h1 class="section-h2">Notes on getting funded</h1>
  <p class="section-sub">What funders look for, what sinks good applications, and what to fix before your next deadline.</p>

  <ul class="post-list">
    {% for post in collections.posts %}
    <li>
      <a href="{{ post.url }}">
        <time datetime="{{ post.date | dateOnly }}" class="post-meta">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</time>
        <h2>{{ post.data.title }}</h2>
        <p>{{ post.data.description }}</p>
      </a>
    </li>
    {% else %}
    <li class="post-empty">The first post is on its way.</li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
</div>
